WEBVTT

01:31.643 --> 01:37.032
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.032 --> 01:39.739
[Episode 13]

01:43.480 --> 01:44.648
Please show your pass.

01:46.239 --> 01:48.560
Next.

02:01.159 --> 02:02.560
Wait another half hour.

02:02.560 --> 02:04.799
I could get home before curfew.

02:15.039 --> 02:16.840
Walk across two more blocks,
and we'll be there.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.599
Curfew time is approaching.

02:18.599 --> 02:21.719
No need to see me out. Please go back.

02:21.719 --> 02:23.680
Your visits are too few.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.000
The Commandant told me

02:25.000 --> 02:26.680
to get you home safely.

02:26.680 --> 02:28.159
Master Xu, the rain is heavy.

02:28.159 --> 02:30.000
Be careful. The roads are wet and slippery.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.680
No need to accompany me further.

02:32.199 --> 02:33.439
You may go back.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.960
Protect…

02:49.319 --> 02:50.408
Master Xu, go.

05:29.639 --> 05:33.600
Since you've seen it,

05:37.279 --> 05:38.800
you can't live anymore.

05:40.120 --> 05:42.399
No.

05:44.439 --> 05:47.920
Don't.

05:53.120 --> 05:54.360
You had a nightmare again?

06:02.560 --> 06:04.839
No, I just dreamed

06:06.279 --> 06:08.079
that we lost money in our business.

06:09.519 --> 06:13.560
Shengyi, I feel better now.

06:14.199 --> 06:15.600
I can work with you today.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.480
We can't do business today.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.800
You have some rest.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.640
Why?

06:22.759 --> 06:25.720
Master Xu died unexpectedly.

06:25.720 --> 06:28.240
It's his burial today.

06:28.240 --> 06:30.319
All the businesses in the city closed.

06:30.319 --> 06:31.920
The people are gathering for his funeral.

06:34.759 --> 06:37.879
When did Master Xu die?

06:38.439 --> 06:39.639
What happened to him?

06:41.000 --> 06:42.839
Some bandits infiltrated the city.

06:43.399 --> 06:46.920
Three days ago,
the night you brought back flowers,

06:46.920 --> 06:48.879
Master Xu was kidnapped by them.

06:48.879 --> 06:51.079
I hear the bandits are extremely vicious.

06:51.079 --> 06:53.480
They killed Master Xu and all his guards.

06:54.360 --> 06:57.120
Their bodies were swept away
by the swollen river

06:57.120 --> 06:58.600
and found the next day.

06:59.399 --> 07:01.759
Fu went to take a look out of curiosity.

07:01.759 --> 07:05.040
He said that the dead were unrecognizable.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.279
Their death was tragic.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.639
It was on the same day.

07:12.639 --> 07:16.199
Indeed, fortunately,
you didn't run into those bandits.

07:16.199 --> 07:18.319
Even thinking of it now scares me.

07:20.040 --> 07:23.120
They say
Master Xu was a great scholar of our time.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.399
He was deeply respected.

07:25.519 --> 07:28.560
He often spoke out for us common folks.

07:29.360 --> 07:33.040
Sadly, no good deed goes unpunished.

07:35.120 --> 07:38.600
Shengyi, my cousin works
at the Imperial Academy.

07:38.600 --> 07:40.600
This must have hit him very hard.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.759
I'll go see him.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.040
You take your medicine now.

07:47.199 --> 07:48.264
Okay.

07:50.519 --> 07:51.688
Okay.

07:53.480 --> 07:57.279
Master Xu, I failed to protect you.

08:02.639 --> 08:04.839
Rest in peace, Master Xu.

08:04.839 --> 08:08.319
I will forever remember you.

08:08.319 --> 08:10.319
I will remember you.

08:11.079 --> 08:13.439
I'll always engrave your teachings.

08:13.439 --> 08:14.480
Rest in peace.

08:14.480 --> 08:15.639
Your virtues

08:15.639 --> 08:17.160
will be forever remembered.

08:17.160 --> 08:20.639
We shall continue the ambition
and move forward.

08:21.720 --> 08:24.600
Rest in peace. I will forever remember you.

08:26.759 --> 08:28.759
Rest in peace.

08:40.200 --> 08:43.159
Excuse me, please call Li Xing out.

08:43.159 --> 08:44.232
Please wait a moment.

08:47.803 --> 08:50.888
[Imperial Academy]

08:55.440 --> 08:56.520
Li Xing.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.296
Mudan.

09:06.799 --> 09:10.159
Li Xing, I've heard about Master Xu's death.

09:10.159 --> 09:11.679
Considering he was your teacher,

09:12.360 --> 09:15.480
I came to see you. I'm so sorry.

09:17.399 --> 09:19.679
Thank you for coming.

09:20.679 --> 09:23.919
I have too many things to do.
So I can't talk for too long.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.559
I need to do things.

09:28.840 --> 09:29.896
Li Xing.

09:31.360 --> 09:34.639
May I ask if Master Xu was grey-haired?

09:35.840 --> 09:38.840
There was a mole here.

09:39.799 --> 09:40.968
You knew him?

09:43.360 --> 09:44.456
It really was him.

09:46.559 --> 09:50.200
I met Master Xu once.

09:51.120 --> 09:53.080
I once received kindness from him.

09:54.399 --> 09:56.000
Could you take me inside?

09:56.840 --> 09:59.480
I'd like to pay my respects to him.

10:00.399 --> 10:01.559
That's what I should do.

10:05.279 --> 10:06.679
Never heard of it.

10:07.919 --> 10:08.919
Come with me.

10:15.279 --> 10:18.480
[Imperial Academy]
Additional Secretary of Ministry of Works came.

10:20.519 --> 10:22.679
For a nation,

10:22.679 --> 10:27.200
the people are the foundation for peace.

10:27.200 --> 10:30.679
Value talent over social status.

10:30.679 --> 10:32.720
Think of the country and the people.

10:36.240 --> 10:38.480
For a nation,

10:38.480 --> 10:42.919
the people are the foundation for peace.

10:42.919 --> 10:46.440
Value talent over social status.

10:46.440 --> 10:48.519
Think of the country and the people.

10:48.519 --> 10:51.879
I thought
most of the officials were as irresponsible

10:52.399 --> 10:54.080
as the County Magistrate of Luoyang.

10:54.799 --> 10:57.360
To my surprise, Master Xu was a good official

10:57.360 --> 10:59.000
adored by the masses.

11:00.600 --> 11:01.840
Master Xu was dedicated to his official duties.

11:03.432 --> 11:04.679
[Funeral]
He devoted himself to his work.

11:05.320 --> 11:08.279
He dedicated all he had
to the nation and its people.

11:11.679 --> 11:13.480
He had no children.

11:15.480 --> 11:17.200
Yet, he had millions of students.

11:19.320 --> 11:20.799
All of whom were his children.

11:24.440 --> 11:28.440
Has the murderer
who killed Master Xu been captured?

11:29.128 --> 11:30.200
[Zu Ping]

11:30.200 --> 11:31.879
Those bandits resisted desperately.

11:33.519 --> 11:35.000
In the end, they were all slain by the Marquis.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.679
But what's the point?

11:43.200 --> 11:44.679
Master Xu is dead.

11:54.039 --> 11:55.080
Li Xing.

11:56.919 --> 11:58.600
Actually, Master Xu--

11:58.600 --> 12:01.840
Vice Minister of Office of Imperial Ceremonies
is here to pay his respects.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.120
Why did he come?

12:09.120 --> 12:11.320
For a nation,

12:11.320 --> 12:15.720
the people are the foundation for peace.

12:15.720 --> 12:19.879
His Majesty sent me to pay respects.

12:22.399 --> 12:24.159
Master Xu.

12:27.399 --> 12:31.519
His Majesty sent me to pay respects.

12:34.039 --> 12:36.960
Master Xu.

12:38.159 --> 12:40.639
Master Xu.

12:49.039 --> 12:52.240
His Majesty sent me to pour libations.

13:00.320 --> 13:03.279
Upon learning of your demise,

13:03.279 --> 13:05.080
His Majesty fainted out of grief.

13:05.679 --> 13:09.240
He regrets not seeing you one last time.

13:10.240 --> 13:12.039
His Majesty has promised

13:12.039 --> 13:16.200
he will surely follow your last wishes.

13:22.440 --> 13:25.360
I'm also so deep in grief.

13:26.480 --> 13:29.840
Over these years, I've always angered you.

13:30.840 --> 13:33.000
I haven't made it right yet.

13:33.720 --> 13:36.320
How could you suddenly leave us?

13:53.799 --> 13:55.720
You were a great scholar

13:56.240 --> 13:58.159
and a tutor of two emperors.

13:58.159 --> 14:01.759
Your contributions to the nation are huge.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.639
I've already ordered people

14:15.639 --> 14:18.639
to erect a monument
and write a biography for you.

14:18.639 --> 14:22.720
Your name shall forever remain in academia,

14:23.480 --> 14:25.399
left in posterity,

14:25.399 --> 14:27.720
and remembered by the public.

14:30.279 --> 14:32.480
Master Xu.

14:37.840 --> 14:40.080
Master Xu.

14:40.080 --> 14:44.759
Li Xing, was he also a student of Master Xu?

14:46.519 --> 14:47.759
Ever since he became a jester,

14:48.919 --> 14:50.519
Master Xu has never acknowledged him
as his student.

14:54.240 --> 14:57.840
He's crying so sadly.

14:59.759 --> 15:02.360
Was he very close to Master Xu before?

15:04.399 --> 15:07.720
In the court, he shields his own faction
and excludes the dissident.

15:07.720 --> 15:09.120
He was always against Master Xu.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.679
He even turned His Majesty

15:10.679 --> 15:12.360
and Master Xu against each other.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.600
No matter how hard he's crying,

15:16.200 --> 15:17.399
it's all an act.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.224
He is shameless.

15:23.480 --> 15:27.120
So, no one can deal with him?

15:27.840 --> 15:31.639
Even if he commits a felony,
will he be pardoned?

15:32.720 --> 15:34.279
His Majesty is deceived by him.

15:35.039 --> 15:36.919
He's long been deaf to the advice of others.

15:38.440 --> 15:41.000
No, I can't watch him make a scene.

15:46.879 --> 15:48.639
I could get a divorce before

15:48.639 --> 15:50.600
because Jiang Changyang was my backer.

15:51.279 --> 15:53.480
If I tell on him,

15:54.000 --> 15:56.519
the truth about Master Xu's death
might not be revealed.

15:57.480 --> 16:00.240
I'm afraid I might be silenced by him.

16:00.960 --> 16:03.559
Master Xu, I'm sorry.

16:04.399 --> 16:05.759
Please take the Floral Envoy away.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.240
Please let Master Xu rest in peace.

16:26.879 --> 16:30.440
Master Xu.

16:40.000 --> 16:43.799
You check why He Weifang is here.

16:43.799 --> 16:44.840
Yes.

16:45.627 --> 16:48.264
[Imperial Academy]

17:00.072 --> 17:01.120
Thank you.

17:01.120 --> 17:02.240
You're welcome. Take care.

17:02.240 --> 17:03.336
See you.

17:05.119 --> 17:07.000
Shengyi, what do you think?

17:07.000 --> 17:08.400
This shop is quite good.

17:08.400 --> 17:10.359
Let's settle on this one.

17:10.359 --> 17:11.920
So, we can--

17:15.559 --> 17:17.519
Are you okay? What's wrong?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.680
- Mudan.
- I'm fine.

17:20.279 --> 17:22.759
Why have you been out of sorts lately?

17:22.759 --> 17:25.000
You've been freaking out about something.

17:26.359 --> 17:29.279
Due to the recent insurrection of the bandits,

17:29.279 --> 17:31.319
I always feel a bit uneasy.

17:31.319 --> 17:32.920
The bandits have been killed
by the authorities.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.000
I watched them being executed.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.680
They're totally dead. No need to worry.

17:38.680 --> 17:41.640
Yes, they all died.

17:41.640 --> 17:43.599
I have nothing to worry about anymore.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.960
I want to discuss something with you guys.

17:49.920 --> 17:53.039
[Property for Sale]
We can't always live in Mr. Jiang's house.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.960
When our business gets better,

17:55.960 --> 17:57.064
let's move out.

17:58.039 --> 17:59.759
Then Ms. Sun can live with us.

17:59.759 --> 18:01.240
the more people, the merrier.

18:01.839 --> 18:04.240
Okay. It's yours.

18:07.799 --> 18:08.799
- Let's go.
- Alright.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.472
Let's go.

18:27.200 --> 18:29.240
Lady He seems to be avoiding you.

18:29.240 --> 18:30.880
Every time she comes
to take care of the Qiongtai Yulu,

18:30.880 --> 18:33.160
you're always not home.

18:33.160 --> 18:34.440
And she comes and goes in a hurry.

18:34.440 --> 18:36.880
She no longer likes chatting
and joking with others like before.

18:57.000 --> 18:59.559
Lady He has relatives in Chang'an.

18:59.559 --> 19:02.240
Li Xing, a student of Master Xu, is her cousin.

19:19.640 --> 19:23.400
Mr. Jiang, in the middle of the night,

19:23.400 --> 19:26.240
why are you sitting on the wall?

19:26.240 --> 19:28.079
Can't you knock on the door?

19:28.079 --> 19:30.279
How could you climb over the wall?

19:30.279 --> 19:34.319
You're freaking me out.

19:36.599 --> 19:39.599
I was just watching the night views
on the wall of my own house.

19:40.559 --> 19:41.920
I didn't mean to scare you.

19:54.759 --> 19:55.839
Could it be

19:57.440 --> 19:58.799
that you're afraid of something?

20:01.240 --> 20:03.039
What are you talking about?

20:15.240 --> 20:17.880
Alright, I can't lie to you.

20:19.680 --> 20:20.839
Here's the thing.

20:20.839 --> 20:23.079
I have selected a shop in the West Market.

20:24.240 --> 20:28.039
I've been troubling you all this time.

20:28.680 --> 20:30.720
So after my shop opens,

20:31.279 --> 20:33.319
I'll pay you back.

20:34.039 --> 20:35.440
I'm easygoing.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.960
So, you're becoming more presumptuous.

20:38.400 --> 20:40.759
I invested money in you for profits.

20:41.319 --> 20:43.279
Yet when you're capable, you want to leave.

20:44.759 --> 20:46.000
You wish.

20:48.839 --> 20:52.880
Yes, I'm just asking you about it.

20:52.880 --> 20:55.519
If you don't agree, I'll forget it.

20:59.359 --> 21:00.839
You're incredibly obedient

21:01.599 --> 21:02.759
and not even talking back to me.

21:05.440 --> 21:07.359
I'm really too tired.

21:07.359 --> 21:09.720
I've used all my energy on many things.

21:10.599 --> 21:11.784
Mr. Jiang, have some water.

21:21.119 --> 21:22.319
The Herbaceous Peonies

21:24.000 --> 21:25.519
were bought five days ago?

21:28.160 --> 21:30.279
I don't quite remember. What about it?

21:30.960 --> 21:33.359
Five days ago, Master Xu of Imperial Academy

21:33.359 --> 21:35.519
was robbed and killed on his way home.

21:35.519 --> 21:36.799
You don't remember this either?

21:38.400 --> 21:40.200
Of course, I know about this.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.079
It caused an uproar throughout the city.

21:42.920 --> 21:45.200
Now that you've reminded me, I remember.

21:45.200 --> 21:46.640
Indeed, the flowers were bought that day.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.319
Is there something wrong?

21:50.960 --> 21:52.480
I have most of the money you earn

21:52.480 --> 21:53.960
through hard work.

21:54.480 --> 21:56.160
So you're sort of one of my people.

21:57.759 --> 22:00.920
None of my followers
are dressed as plainly as you.

22:00.920 --> 22:05.319
Isn't the money you've earned enough
to buy new dresses?

22:08.440 --> 22:10.599
You're acting very strange.

22:12.960 --> 22:16.039
You asked me when I bought these flowers

22:16.839 --> 22:20.119
and found my clothes odd.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.759
What's wrong with you?

22:24.519 --> 22:26.160
One night, when I was walking at night,

22:27.240 --> 22:29.000
I saw a flower from a distance.

22:30.240 --> 22:33.519
I wondered why there was an Herbaceous Peony
in a quiet, secluded alley.

22:35.039 --> 22:36.279
I went to see the flower.

22:38.960 --> 22:40.559
And to my surprise, I found this.

22:43.279 --> 22:44.799
You always haggle over every ounce,

22:45.720 --> 22:47.319
Since I tore your dress,

22:48.359 --> 22:49.640
naturally, I have to compensate.

22:50.759 --> 22:51.912
What do you say?

23:30.759 --> 23:32.839
This is just a very ordinary piece of cloth.

23:33.559 --> 23:36.960
I'm not the only person
in Chang'an wearing this.

23:37.720 --> 23:40.960
Mr. Jiang, did you find this piece of rag

23:40.960 --> 23:42.279
just to make fun of me?

23:50.759 --> 23:52.599
It seems I misunderstood you.

23:54.400 --> 23:55.880
That's because

23:56.480 --> 23:59.839
you aren't sincere with me and hid something.

24:01.640 --> 24:04.400
You keep saying things to me
like they're supposed to mean something.

24:05.079 --> 24:06.559
What is wrong with me?

24:07.640 --> 24:10.519
When you came to Chang'an,
you said you had no relatives.

24:11.319 --> 24:12.559
What about Li Xing?

24:14.039 --> 24:16.160
He is your cousin.

24:21.880 --> 24:23.599
I don't know what I did wrong

24:23.599 --> 24:24.920
to make you investigate me.

24:25.880 --> 24:27.160
Li Xing is my cousin.

24:27.759 --> 24:29.599
But when my mother was still alive,

24:29.599 --> 24:32.559
she cut ties with my aunt.

24:32.559 --> 24:34.599
We were not close.

24:35.599 --> 24:39.000
Otherwise, why didn't I ask him for help
when I was in trouble?

24:39.000 --> 24:40.240
Why did I borrow money from you?

24:43.119 --> 24:44.480
After Master Xu passed away,

24:44.480 --> 24:47.440
Li Xing led others to curse me
by writing poems and essays.

24:49.000 --> 24:50.240
This has nothing to do with you?

24:51.880 --> 24:54.839
That's why you're questioning me?

24:57.319 --> 24:59.799
Mr. Jiang, I swear

24:59.799 --> 25:01.640
I have nothing to do with this.

25:03.000 --> 25:04.240
I have what I have today

25:04.240 --> 25:06.440
thanks to your help.

25:06.440 --> 25:09.000
How could I possibly join others
in gossiping about you?

25:10.240 --> 25:11.519
Previously in Luoyang,

25:11.519 --> 25:13.279
you defended justice
and helped me get a divorce.

25:13.279 --> 25:16.079
Not long ago, I witnessed you adopting orphans
with my own eyes.

25:16.720 --> 25:18.880
I care not what others think of you.

25:18.880 --> 25:20.640
In my eyes,

25:20.640 --> 25:24.119
you are a person of benevolence and virtue.

25:24.119 --> 25:27.119
How could I possibly be so ungrateful
and look for trouble?

25:29.759 --> 25:31.240
You're just timid.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.480
If you have an opportunity,

25:33.480 --> 25:35.440
I fear you're the first to scold me.

25:35.960 --> 25:37.759
You're open-minded.

25:37.759 --> 25:39.759
What else do I have to complain about?

25:39.759 --> 25:40.799
I just like

25:40.799 --> 25:43.480
to joke with you.

25:43.480 --> 25:44.559
Don't be serious.

25:45.240 --> 25:48.160
I promise. My lips are sealed.

25:51.519 --> 25:52.584
Jiang Changyang.

25:55.039 --> 25:56.559
I'm just an ordinary citizen.

25:57.359 --> 26:00.720
I just want
to make a little money for a living.

26:12.279 --> 26:16.359
I hope you remain a wise person all your life.

26:27.920 --> 26:30.039
Even if you can fly high,

26:30.720 --> 26:32.559
don't forget

26:34.279 --> 26:35.559
who pulls the strings.

26:36.920 --> 26:40.240
Understood. I do whatever you say.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.200
A flower shop opens.

27:17.200 --> 27:19.119
Go and look. Maybe they're doing promotions.

27:19.119 --> 27:20.799
Huamanzhu

27:20.799 --> 27:23.359
is open.

27:23.899 --> 27:26.632
[Huamanzhu]

27:27.200 --> 27:28.640
They've actually opened a shop.

27:28.640 --> 27:31.559
Ladies and gentlemen, Huamanzhu opens today.

27:31.559 --> 27:33.079
To celebrate the opening,

27:33.079 --> 27:36.319
within three days, a purchase of one item
gets a discount of five wen.

27:36.319 --> 27:38.880
For two items, twelve wen, with no upper limit.

27:38.880 --> 27:42.480
Welcome everyone to come, please.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.599
Please come in.

27:43.599 --> 27:44.640
Let's go in.

27:44.640 --> 27:45.839
- Please come in.
- Come on.

27:45.839 --> 27:47.759
[Opening]
Please come in.

27:47.759 --> 27:49.480
You look exceedingly beautiful today.

27:49.480 --> 27:51.079
- Mudan.
- Please come in.

27:51.079 --> 27:52.799
- Mudan.
- Congratulations.

27:54.359 --> 27:57.079
Fresh flowers, fragrant powder.

28:02.720 --> 28:04.400
You actually redeemed it back.

28:05.279 --> 28:08.480
To open the shop,
you've invested all your money.

28:08.480 --> 28:11.279
I know you've always had this on your mind.

28:12.960 --> 28:14.839
Good things come in pairs.

28:18.920 --> 28:20.072
Thank you, Shengyi.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.040
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

28:25.359 --> 28:27.680
Madam, this kind of fragrant powder

28:27.680 --> 28:29.160
is made from this flower.

28:32.480 --> 28:33.576
It smells so good.

28:34.400 --> 28:36.759
This one has a sweeter taste.

28:36.759 --> 28:38.519
Stir it a bit.

28:38.519 --> 28:39.560
Put it through a sieve.

28:42.119 --> 28:43.176
Please enjoy.

28:43.799 --> 28:44.840
Thank you.

28:44.840 --> 28:45.896
Please.

28:47.960 --> 28:48.960
Welcome to come again.

28:54.480 --> 28:56.440
We have two ways of selling Herbaceous Peonies.

28:56.440 --> 28:59.440
First, you can pre-order the seedlings
according to color.

28:59.440 --> 29:01.519
We will plant them for you in the autumn.

29:02.079 --> 29:05.416
When the flowers bloom next year,
you make the payment.

29:05.416 --> 29:06.640
Second,

29:06.640 --> 29:08.279
buy and take away immediately.

29:09.799 --> 29:11.880
So you mean

29:11.880 --> 29:13.759
all the Herbaceous Peonies here

29:13.759 --> 29:15.160
are available to sell?

29:15.839 --> 29:19.000
Yes, but the flowers have their own habits.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.960
The flowers in season

29:20.960 --> 29:23.920
have a slightly shorter blooming period.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.359
However, the good thing is

29:25.359 --> 29:27.720
that you can enjoy the blooming flowers in time

29:27.720 --> 29:29.400
without waiting a whole year.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.759
Of course, it's up to you to choose.

29:31.759 --> 29:33.440
It depends on your preferences.

29:34.279 --> 29:37.359
It's better to enjoy it at a good time.

29:37.359 --> 29:39.880
Who knows what will happen next year?

29:39.880 --> 29:41.599
Madam, I'll buy

29:41.599 --> 29:42.920
two purple peonies

29:42.920 --> 29:44.680
to enjoy their stunning beauty.

29:44.680 --> 29:46.799
Alright, please go to the main hall

29:46.799 --> 29:48.400
and pick the flowers you like.

29:48.400 --> 29:50.599
We'll have someone deliver them
to your residence later.

29:50.599 --> 29:51.624
Thank you.

29:52.880 --> 29:54.440
I would like to buy two peonies.

29:54.440 --> 29:56.400
Can you transplant them in my courtyard today?

29:56.400 --> 29:59.000
The flowers cannot be transplanted
when they are in bloom.

29:59.000 --> 30:00.960
Otherwise, it'll damage their roots and stems.

30:01.640 --> 30:03.160
If you want,

30:03.160 --> 30:05.119
wait until autumn,
which is a suitable season to transplant.

30:05.119 --> 30:07.599
I can transplant them for you then.

30:07.599 --> 30:09.279
Alright then, I'll order two plants.

30:09.279 --> 30:10.359
Okay, this way, please.

30:10.359 --> 30:11.464
Okay.

30:12.872 --> 30:15.400
[Jingsheng Hall]

30:15.400 --> 30:18.240
Your Highness, the Yellow River dyke
in Xiangzhou has been breached.

30:18.240 --> 30:20.640
The people from the Ministry of Revenue
will be sent to provide disaster relief.

30:20.640 --> 30:22.400
Please allow me to go there.

30:23.759 --> 30:25.480
Disaster relief is a huge issue.

30:26.079 --> 30:28.480
You're new here. It's not appropriate
for you to intervene.

30:29.359 --> 30:30.440
Besides,

30:30.960 --> 30:33.160
Youzhen can't let you suffer.

30:34.240 --> 30:35.368
Good.

30:36.720 --> 30:38.279
Although I don't have much experience,

30:38.279 --> 30:39.400
I'm not afraid of hardship.

30:40.200 --> 30:42.839
If you do this job, have you ever thought about

30:44.000 --> 30:46.599
what you will benefit from it?

30:47.599 --> 30:50.039
Your Highness, I am an official.

30:50.039 --> 30:52.119
It's my duty to devote myself to the nation.

30:52.759 --> 30:54.000
I never expect to benefit from it.

30:54.759 --> 30:58.640
Zishu, you should take a more long-term view.

30:59.440 --> 31:02.480
Do you know who's the master

31:02.480 --> 31:04.119
of this world?

31:08.079 --> 31:09.759
There are many officials
in charge of disaster relief.

31:09.759 --> 31:12.079
It's not easy for you to stand out among them.

31:12.079 --> 31:13.680
It's of no benefit to your official career.

31:14.599 --> 31:17.319
I've already arranged another task for you.

31:17.319 --> 31:19.839
It is simple and will allow you
to make connections with important officials.

31:21.079 --> 31:23.680
When a higher position becomes available,

31:23.680 --> 31:25.240
you can be promoted.

31:30.760 --> 31:31.816
Great.

31:36.559 --> 31:38.720
I will take my leave.

31:48.400 --> 31:51.599
Liu Zishu is conceited.

31:53.400 --> 31:54.759
He does not know

31:54.759 --> 31:58.319
what he should do as my son-in-law.

32:02.559 --> 32:05.119
Your Highness, Mr. Liu is still young.

32:05.119 --> 32:06.680
He just needs more guidance.

32:06.680 --> 32:08.440
Your Highness is ambitious.

32:08.440 --> 32:11.400
He will have the chance to show his abilities.

32:12.519 --> 32:13.576
Good.

32:19.119 --> 32:20.232
My lord.

32:26.160 --> 32:28.079
Weren't they originally
in His Highness's study?

32:28.079 --> 32:29.480
Where are they to be taken now?

32:30.088 --> 32:31.208
My lord,

32:31.208 --> 32:32.279
every day, officials send

32:32.279 --> 32:34.119
articles and poems of flattery here.

32:34.119 --> 32:36.839
His Highness has ordered me
to regularly burn them.

32:36.839 --> 32:38.160
After all, these things take up space.

32:38.160 --> 32:39.240
Burn them?

32:59.200 --> 33:00.232
My lord.

33:07.359 --> 33:09.359
No wonder Prince Ning rejected my proposal.

33:10.400 --> 33:13.119
It turns out he never even read my articles.

33:16.720 --> 33:17.759
In his eyes,

33:18.559 --> 33:21.000
I am just an incapable person
who pleases a woman.

33:22.200 --> 33:25.720
I'm not different
from music and dance performers.

33:35.319 --> 33:37.599
I've asked for leave on your behalf.

33:37.599 --> 33:40.680
Let's stay at Mount Li for a while tomorrow.

33:47.839 --> 33:49.920
The scenery of Mount Li is beautiful,

33:49.920 --> 33:52.880
but the food there is not very good.

33:52.880 --> 33:55.920
How about we
bring the chef from Fuguilou along?

33:59.440 --> 34:01.960
I can't always ask for leave.

34:01.960 --> 34:04.359
Otherwise, what's the point
of the Ministry of Revenue hiring me?

34:06.880 --> 34:08.319
If it's all about eating,
drinking, and relaxing,

34:09.000 --> 34:10.599
why should I come to Chang'an?

34:15.760 --> 34:18.440
Did the Ministry of Revenue upset you?

34:21.320 --> 34:22.408
No.

34:33.280 --> 34:35.079
Since we're leaving the city tomorrow,

34:35.079 --> 34:37.960
I must return to finish my work right now.

34:37.960 --> 34:40.400
I'm afraid I can't have dinner
with you tonight.

34:56.519 --> 34:58.519
My lord, please stop drinking.

34:59.079 --> 35:00.280
You need to get up early tomorrow.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.800
If Lady Li smells the scent of alcohol on you,

35:03.920 --> 35:06.320
she might guess you didn't go back to work.

35:11.280 --> 35:12.920
I didn't spoil her mood.

35:13.480 --> 35:16.320
I just drank in secret to drown my sorrows.

35:18.039 --> 35:19.960
Why should I do anything

35:19.960 --> 35:21.559
with her permission?

35:32.119 --> 35:34.376
You may go. Leave me alone.

35:34.376 --> 35:35.400
My lord.

35:35.400 --> 35:36.440
Get out of here.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.400
Take care. Come again.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.416
Okay.

35:57.128 --> 35:58.239
How much is this?

35:58.239 --> 36:00.639
This is for decoration. It's not for sale.

36:00.639 --> 36:02.000
- Please come in.
- If you like it, it's yours for free.

36:03.519 --> 36:05.239
If you buy five plants,
we'll give you a free one.

36:16.320 --> 36:17.519
Take care.

36:17.519 --> 36:19.480
I came all this way for nothing.

36:20.000 --> 36:23.239
Tomorrow, you must personally
deliver the incense powder to me

36:23.239 --> 36:24.760
and have tea with me.

36:25.920 --> 36:26.920
The day before yesterday,

36:26.920 --> 36:29.280
your wife bought the incense powder
from my shop.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.400
Has she used it all up so soon?

36:31.039 --> 36:35.039
Well then, I'll visit your wife tomorrow

36:35.039 --> 36:36.239
for her patronage.

36:37.039 --> 36:38.880
I don't buy it for her.

36:38.880 --> 36:41.360
Madam, please don't cause me trouble.

36:42.320 --> 36:44.199
I am not good at telling lies.

36:44.199 --> 36:46.840
Tomorrow, l'll send the cleverest clerk

36:46.840 --> 36:48.000
to deliver the goods to your residence.

36:48.648 --> 36:49.679
My lady.

36:49.679 --> 36:50.719
My lord, you…

36:52.840 --> 36:55.079
You drunken man, didn't you see me?

37:02.320 --> 37:03.464
Do you know each other?

37:03.464 --> 37:04.599
No, we don't.

37:14.400 --> 37:16.639
Shouldn't you apologize before you leave?

37:19.119 --> 37:21.760
When you harassed a woman on the street,

37:21.760 --> 37:24.280
you bumped into me.

37:28.719 --> 37:30.719
You're just a minor official.

37:30.719 --> 37:32.599
Aren't you supposed to work right now?

37:32.599 --> 37:35.719
Now, you're drunk and spouting nonsense.

37:35.719 --> 37:39.840
I can tell you're a good-for-nothing bum.

37:40.440 --> 37:42.079
You have good looks,

37:42.079 --> 37:43.760
but you only dare
to act recklessly here, right?

37:49.280 --> 37:50.440
Do you know who I am?

37:51.960 --> 37:53.079
Stop staring at me.

37:54.039 --> 37:55.920
I don't care who you are.

38:00.440 --> 38:01.639
Who is this man?

38:03.920 --> 38:06.559
Beat him hard.

38:06.559 --> 38:08.760
Beat him to death.

38:11.320 --> 38:12.552
It hurts so much.

38:13.239 --> 38:14.248
Hit him.

38:14.840 --> 38:15.840
Hit him hard.

38:23.760 --> 38:24.800
[County Princess Ji'an]
This is a token.

38:25.639 --> 38:26.696
Stop.

38:31.920 --> 38:34.639
My lord, you work for Prince Ning?

38:36.800 --> 38:38.719
Why didn't you tell me just now?

38:38.719 --> 38:41.000
I made a stupid mistake.

38:41.000 --> 38:44.079
I'm such a fool. Please spare me.

38:44.079 --> 38:46.079
Keep hitting me. Why have you stopped?

38:47.920 --> 38:50.199
Please spare me.

38:52.239 --> 38:54.400
Get out of here.

38:56.920 --> 38:58.559
Well…

39:00.119 --> 39:01.320
Get lost.

39:02.824 --> 39:03.912
Yes.

39:03.912 --> 39:05.480
Get out of here.

39:23.000 --> 39:24.360
The shopkeeper asks you to leave.

39:24.920 --> 39:27.119
Please do not affect our business.

39:33.360 --> 39:36.719
She gave this medicine to me?

39:37.519 --> 39:40.800
Yes, please leave right now.

39:44.400 --> 39:45.448
Thank you.

39:56.440 --> 39:57.960
When I had no official post,

39:59.239 --> 40:00.960
you were distant and cold to me.

40:03.039 --> 40:04.440
Now that I am an official,

40:06.679 --> 40:09.159
you still do not look up to me.

40:13.719 --> 40:15.719
Others respect this token.

40:19.119 --> 40:20.232
Yet in your eyes,

40:22.840 --> 40:27.519
I have always been just Liu Zishu.

40:35.400 --> 40:38.119
I didn't expect
that you had been married before

40:39.119 --> 40:41.880
and had experienced such terrible things.

40:43.119 --> 40:44.880
I didn't intentionally hide it.

40:44.880 --> 40:47.440
I just felt that speaking of it
would only cause unnecessary trouble.

40:48.920 --> 40:50.199
You won't blame me, will you?

40:51.320 --> 40:52.320
No, we won't.

40:52.840 --> 40:55.199
You dared to curse the County Magistrate

40:55.199 --> 40:56.920
to defend yourself and obtain a divorce.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.039
You are truly a heroine.

41:02.199 --> 41:05.320
Liu Chang is different from his parents.

41:05.320 --> 41:07.079
He ponders his mistakes and apologizes.

41:07.079 --> 41:08.079
Wealth does not blind him.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.760
He is much better than Wang Qing.

41:11.559 --> 41:13.719
He's sincere towards you.

41:14.840 --> 41:17.039
Such a gentleman cares about you,

41:17.039 --> 41:18.800
which makes me envious.

41:19.599 --> 41:22.840
Shengyi, truly caring for someone
is not like this.

41:24.280 --> 41:26.920
He doesn't care what I think and pesters me.

41:26.920 --> 41:29.519
It shows his selfishness, not deep affection.

41:30.559 --> 41:33.119
You don't need to envy me.

41:52.923 --> 41:59.197
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:01.051 --> 42:07.735
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:08.411 --> 42:15.609
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:16.603 --> 42:24.955
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:24.955 --> 42:32.498
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:33.152 --> 42:41.339
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:41.339 --> 42:49.150
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:49.755 --> 42:57.047
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:17.723 --> 43:24.606
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:25.907 --> 43:32.601
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

43:33.358 --> 43:40.660
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:41.344 --> 43:49.653
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:49.653 --> 43:57.084
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

43:57.915 --> 44:06.171
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:06.171 --> 44:13.595
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:14.599 --> 44:22.049
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
